msgid "plugins.generic.autoAnnounce.name"
msgstr "Automatic Announcements"

msgid "plugins.generic.autoAnnounce.description"
msgstr "Creates a site announcement automatically when each issue is published (with its table of contents and article links) in Arabic and English, optionally when each article is published, and generates ready-to-post texts for X, LinkedIn, WhatsApp and Telegram with your hashtags, with a log that prevents duplicates. Developed by Moustafa Mahmoud — Khibrat Taibah."

