msgstr "Open announcements"

msgid "plugins.generic.autoAnnounce.menu"
msgstr "Announcements"

msgid "plugins.generic.autoAnnounce.intro"
msgstr "When you publish an issue from \"Issues\", its announcement is created automatically. You can also announce a past issue or an article manually, and take ready text for social media."

msgid "plugins.generic.autoAnnounce.annOff"
msgstr "Announcements are disabled for the journal; enable them in Settings → Website → Announcements so readers see them."

